In this project, I implemented the Binary Search algorithm using C++.
* Created a sorted array for searching operations.
* Implemented binary search using low, high, and middle indices.
* Compared the target value with the middle element to reduce the search space.
* Updated search boundaries based on the comparison result.
* Displayed whether the element was found or not.
* Improved search efficiency compared to linear searching.
* Practiced conditional statements, loops, and algorithm implementation.
* Explored Binary Tree concepts and related data structure topics.
This project helped me understand binary search, searching algorithms, time complexity optimization, and basic tree-related concepts in C++.
